地供应计划编制报告书", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 1845306, "sourcename": "三明市国土资源局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://zrzyj.sm.gov.cn/ztzl/gdjhzl/201804/t20180409_1096312.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://zrzyj.sm.gov.cn/ztzl/gdjhzl/201804/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 353495, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "供应计划", "chnldocurl": "http://zrzyj.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/gtzyj/zfxxgkml/ghjh_2322/201608/t20160811_353495.htm", "content": "\n\n各县（市）国土资源局，梅列、三元分局： \n　　经市政府同意，现将2016年土地利用计划新增建设用地指标预下达给你们，并就有关事项通知如下，请认真贯彻落实。 \n　　一、新增建设用地指标安排总体要求 \n　", "docabstract": "关于预下达2016年新增建设用地指标的通知", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://zrzyj.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/gtzyj/zfxxgkml/ghjh_2322/201608/t20160811_353495.htm", "docreltime": "2016.03.31 09:56:00", "doctitle": "三明市国土资源局关于预下达2016年新增建设用地指标的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明国土资综〔2016〕35号", "idxid": "SM00114-03-2016-00001", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2016.03.31 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市国土资源局", "recid": 1845304, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://zrzyj.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/gtzyj/zfxxgkml/ghjh_2322/201608/t20160811_353495.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://zrzyj.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/gtzyj/zfxxgkml/ghjh_2322/201608/", "rels": []}]}